      "content": "it just feels like the whole thing was a lie, you know? like all that love and connection was just a temporary distraction before the silence comes back. if everything just ends in this kind of hollow feeling, what's even the point of trying to build something or care about anything? it feels so irrational to keep going through the motions when the only thing that actually made sense is gone.",
